00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:48,160
Yeah, Helm is a macOS and iOS app that basically allows you to do a lot of actions in App Store Connect.

26
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:53,040
I don't like saying that it's just a client for App Store Connect because we because we do quite a lot more.

27
00:01:53,440 --> 00:02:08,720
The mission with Helm is to basically put all the frustrations and pain points that we had when shipping our apps and updates in Upstore Connect and basically fix them like one at a time, making like the best possible experience for every single feature that we come up with in the app.

28
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:28,400
The goal essentially is to make it as easy as possible to launch your app, give you the best chances at success, at getting past the review process, giving you the best chance at like ASO, auto-translating your content so that you basically don't have to either hire someone and you can do it in just like one.

29
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:29,200
click.

30
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:39,440
